# MaxxOps consumes this release

A version bump includes the git commit, push, tag, and `npm publish` (`publish-release-tag.mdc`). After `npm view @logimaxx/kgrid@X.Y.Z version` succeeds, update the MaxxOps checkout in the same task so it resolves to that version. A caret that already allows it is not enough. Do not point MaxxOps at a version that is not on npm.

In sibling `maxxops_latest` (or the workspace checkout), `src/frontend`:

- `"kgrid": "npm:@logimaxx/kgrid@^X.Y.Z"`
- refresh the lockfile with npm

Do not point MaxxOps at `file:` or a local tarball. If that checkout is not available, say so and name `src/frontend/package.json`.
